### -eq between a bare word and a quoted letter
[ count -eq 'n' ] && echo "odd"
>>> SC2050 1:9
>>> SC2170 1:13
>>> SC2170 1:3

### numeric operands are fine
[ $reply -eq 10 ] && echo "ten"
>>> SC2086 1:3
>>> SC2154 1:3

### signs and dots are fine
[ "$delta" -lt -5 ] && echo "dropped"
>>> SC2154 1:4
